roup":285,"sort_no":192,"p_sort_no":19,"subtitle":463,"description":464,"link_url":465,"novel_no":466,"flag_cate":260,"flag_content":138,"content_type":143,"novel_name":467,"writer_name":341,"novel_story":468,"novel_img":469,"flag_adult":19,"flag_complete":19,"count_epi":470,"count_view":471,"count_like":472,"count_good":473,"new_epi_num":474,"new_epi_open_dt":348,"novel_open_dt":475,"flag_live":19,"flag_detail_trans":19,"detail_trans_dt":125,"novel_tag_list":476,"additional_data":479,"cover_img":22},172369,[],[],"/novel/3996",3996,"After the Breakup, She Dragged Me Into Her Obsession","Even after ending things with the childhood sweetheart who had stayed by his side for years, he never realized that someone else had already been watching him from the dark for a very long time.\n\nHe was too slow to notice the eyes fixed on him, and far too naïve to understand that once the shadows finally closed around him and the tide pulled him under, there would be no way left to climb back out.\n\nHe used to think that calling her sister would keep a line between them, that as long as he stayed on his side of it, nothing would ever truly change. He did not know that, to her, that line had already disappeared.\n\n[Cover Character: Evelyn Miller]","https://gn.novelpia.com/upload/novel/3996/571f001a2c506659266ee32f65ea228517803289517721056353678",130,32683,579,133,129,"2026-02-03 06:00:43",[371,232,157,231,159,185,477,478,352],"Sister","Modern",{},{"idx":481,"main_group":285,"sort_no":482,"p_sort_no":19,"subtitle":483,"description":484,"link_url":485,"novel_no":486,"flag_cate":138,"flag_content":138,"content_type":143,"novel_name":487,"writer_name":320,"novel_story":488,"novel_img":489,"flag_adult":19,"flag_complete":19,"count_epi":490,"count_view":491,"count_like":492,"count_good":142,"new_epi_num":493,"new_epi_open_dt":348,"novel_open_dt":494,"flag_live":19,"flag_detail_trans":19,"detail_trans_dt":125,"novel_tag_list":495,"additional_data":499,"cover_img":22},172410,17,[],[],"/novel/4702",4702,"Tales Of The Three Skies","In the continent of Aezeir, destruction reigned. Demons, angels, and demi-humans slaughtered humanity at the command of the evil gods. What began as divine judgment became an endless war that devoured the world itself.\n\nWhen the gods turned upon one another, the heavens shattered. The six who defended mankind were slain, and the remaining evil gods, consumed by hatred, allied with the Demon God to cleanse the world of humans. For a thousand years, blood and despair stained the lands.\n\n\nAs the World Tree burned and the last light of humanity began to fade, the continent itself wept. From the dying earth, three souls were born, a final miracle of the world’s will, destined to rise when all else was lost.\n\n\nTheir birth marked the end of the Age of Despair and the beginning of the Era of Dawn.\nWhen light once again dared to challenge the darkness,\nand the fate of Aezeir would be rewritten.","https://gn.novelpia.com/upload/novel/4702/69a60707c671e73e68fd432473ae9f0117763997050281798606992",57,1185,69,56,"2026-04-17 04:32:58",[157,183,161,330,439,496,497,498,233],"Drama","Female Protagonist","Saintess",{},{"idx":501,"main_group":285,"sort_no":502,"p_sort_no":19,"subtitle":503,"description":504,"link_url":505,"novel_no":506,"flag_cate":291,"flag_content":138,"content_type":143,"novel_name":507,"writer_name":508,"novel_story":509,"novel_img":510,"flag_adult":19,"flag_complete":19,"count_epi":511,"count_view":512,"count_like":513,"count_good":514,"new_epi_num":515,"new_epi_open_dt":516,"novel_open_dt":517,"flag_live":19,"flag_detail_trans":19,"detail_trans_dt":181,"novel_tag_list":518,"additional_data":522,"cover_img":22},172379,13,[],[],"/novel/3471",3471,"The Flesh Bender Attend The Academy","EliteToeCollector","I woke up in the body of Clyde Redmane. An orphan, broke, bullied kid living in a monster-ridden world of heroes and superpowers. But instead of awakening to some flashy ability like fire, lightning, or strength, I inherited Clyde’s terrifying gift. The power to twist, sculpt, and weaponize my own flesh and bone. \n\nA grotesque ability everyone fears… yet it’s the only thing I have as I step into Avaraine Heroic Academy, a place where heroes are forged to fight against monsters beyond humanity's wall, and where one wrong move can get me expelled—or killed.\n\n----\nPlease forgive me for any grammar mistake as English is not my main language. (Any criticism is always welcomed!) \n\n*trigger warning*\nThere is grotesque element which is basically the main core of the story, I'm sure I am pretty bad at describing it but still trigger warning.","https://gn.novelpia.com/upload/novel/3471/42af11e144e7479a2ea526a812ff226f17688202868524671422786",93,26782,481,208,92,"2026-06-06 12:31:04","2025-12-09 09:44:00",[307,519,520,440,160,521],"Hero","Villain","Monsters",{},{"idx":524,"main_group":285,"sort_no":260,"p_sort_no":19,"subtitle":525,"description":526,"link_url":527,"novel_no":528,"flag_cate":138,"flag_content":138,"content_type":143,"novel_name":529,"writer_name":530,"novel_story":531,"novel_img":532,"flag_adult":19,"flag_complete":19,"count_epi":533,"count_view":534,"count_like":285,"count_good":19,"new_epi_num":535,"new_epi_open_dt":536,"novel_open_dt":537,"flag_live":19,"flag_detail_trans":19,"detail_trans_dt":125,"novel_tag_list":538,"additional_data":543,"cover_img":22},172372,[],[],"/novel/4325",4325,"New World Mimic","CainShax","Isekai comes in many forms. In my case, the story is different from the usual one. I returned from another world, retaining certain magical abilities—or perhaps system skills—after spending only a few days in a coma in my own world… while far more time had passed in the other one. And now I’m back in my former body, the body of someone who has been through a lot, yet still… achieved his goal. Now I can finally live a normal life again. All that’s left is to find her—she came back with me too—and then we’ll finally be able to…\nAttention! A System has descended upon your world! Fight or die! Location update error! Please wait…\nGods damn it…\n","https://gn.novelpia.com/upload/novel/4325/333c7befcc5f17f9a0f098c0a80e5a6517730679256694802998359",35,719,34,"2026-05-29 12:28:12","2026-03-09 14:58:25",[459,310,539,521,184,540,541,542,440],"Survival","Male Lead","Dark Fantasy","Post-Apocalypse",{},{"idx":545,"main_group":285,"sort_no":143,"p_sort_no":19,"subtitle":546,"description":547,"link_url":548,"novel_no":549,"flag_cate":192,"flag_content":138,"content_type":143,"novel_name":550,"writer_name":341,"novel_story":551,"novel_img":552,"flag_adult":19,"flag_complete":19,"count_epi":553,"count_view":554,"count_like":555,"count_good":556,"new_epi_num":553,"new_epi_open_dt":348,"novel_open_dt":557,"flag_live":19,"flag_detail_trans":19,"detail_trans_dt":125,"novel_tag_list":558,"additional_data":563,"cover_img":22},172368,[],[],"/novel/4723",4723,"After Transmigrating as a Side Character, I Just Want a Quiet Life","After dying from overwork, Reed Hale wakes up inside a romance game as a disposable side character whose name sounds almost exactly like his own.\n\nThere is only one problem: in the original story, that character ruins his life over a girl and ends up in prison.\n\nReed wants none of it. He just wants to shake off the original host’s lingering obsession, find a strong backer, make some money, enjoy drawing, games, good food, and live quietly.\n\nThat plan falls apart fast.\n\nThe childhood friend who never looked his way refuses to let him drift away. The younger sister he kept at arm’s length starts pushing past every line. The powerful woman he chose as his safest shelter decides she would rather keep him. Even his longtime online game partner begins wanting more than a voice through a headset.\n\nBy the time Reed realizes he is trapped, the way back is already gone.\n\nWhat waits for him is not romance, but a cage built from patience, longing, and obsession.\n\n[Cover Character: Vivian Rowan]","https://gn.novelpia.com/upload/novel/4723/36938250b739997cd1763cd7769640451780731733238832475331",67,52305,582,367,"2026-04-20 03:38:17",[559,560,186,159,311,371,231,561,562],"Romance","Mystery","Early System","Slow Burn",{},{"idx":565,"main_group":285,"sort_no":212,"p_sort_no":19,"subtitle":566,"description":567,"link_url":568,"novel_no":569,"flag_cate":260,"flag_content":138,"content_type":143,"novel_name":570,"writer_name":341,"novel_story":571,"novel_img":572,"flag_adult":19,"flag_complete":138,"count_epi":573,"count_view":574,"count_like":575,"count_good":473,"new_epi_num":573,"new_epi_open_dt":576,"novel_open_dt":577,"flag_live":19,"flag_detail_trans":19,"detail_trans_dt":125,"novel_tag_list":578,"additional_data":581,"cover_img":22},172370,[],[],"/novel/3700",3700,"After the Rainy Night, I Was Caught in the Underworld Queen’s Embrace","Chase Ford was born into wealth and status, the golden son of a powerful family. But at nineteen, everything fell apart. In a single year, he became a disgraced heir with nothing left to his name. Cold, proud, and graceful, he valued his dignity more than his own life.\n\nBy chance, he was forced to save a woman steeped in blood and violence, someone whose reputation alone struck fear across the criminal world. Her name was Wren Mercer, a woman people whispered about like a curse.\n\nShe did not understand love. She was only capable of taking.\n\nHe pushed forward through the mud, enduring everything in silence, while she lost herself in the thrill of training him into her dog.\n\nShe treated him like something wild to be broken.\nHe swallowed humiliation and waited, growing sharper and stronger, until his wings were finally strong enough for him to tear apart the fragile illusion of balance between them with his own hands.\n\nOnly then did Wren wake up. There had never been submission. Not once.","https://gn.novelpia.com/upload/novel/3700/967650a24610ec86e098bbbc7e176d461778089403267893874635",125,46161,520,"2026-05-31 00:00:00","2026